        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"a65b9956-5bc6-43da-b26e-d151d8ff0dc6\",\"review_text\":\"Worst search engine ever i've never seen an application with such worst search engine. Sorry Spotify i am uninstalling you.\"},{\"review_id\":\"a43760bb-0410-477f-879e-b08c648b7fc5\",\"review_text\":\"Wa TT\"},{\"review_id\":\"9a904b8e-125a-498f-b847-77ce0b41d91d\",\"review_text\":\"Does not play like it use to cuts off every 3-5 seconds or not at all, getting to be like pandora.\"},{\"review_id\":\"9453c7f9-907a-4af8-b3a1-9d7b7430d31f\",\"review_text\":\"New updates are just waste of my time I'm gonna uninstall this bcoz every thing is paid shuffle music is paid if you don't want us to listen it just erase your Spotify from play store.\"},{\"review_id\":\"c539c5f0-e439-44f0-812a-e538c2263b51\",\"review_text\":\"Hate this application👎 Block this app playstore From\"},{\"review_id\":\"884efd67-05e8-4c0e-a3eb-ac2e76c710bf\",\"review_text\":\"Love 💕♾️\"},{\"review_id\":\"6b673d9e-029d-42e9-ae1b-584133222158\",\"review_text\":\"Every song I want I get, plus I like the way the songs changes like a dj mix😍😍\"},{\"review_id\":\"d55683cf-0329-4c0d-a69e-fabb9492bf8e\",\"review_text\":\"Just amazing I enjoyed everyone music\"},{\"review_id\":\"d5bb1b26-6ea8-47ea-a402-053cf230f806\",\"review_text\":\"Disgusting, removing songs bc they're \\\"hateful\\\".\"},{\"review_id\":\"7168a6dc-3e70-482b-8cbc-a0ab705087c7\",\"review_text\":\"Superb music appreciation\"}]}"
